#X text 82 1052 0 ptch (67) \; 1 dec (10) \; 2 mod (8) \; 3 hpf (15) \; 4 snar (38) \; 5 sptc (25) \; 6 sdec (59) \; 7 smod (0), f 64;
#X obj 60 1208 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Choke\ and\ presets 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 1232 Outlet 1 sends 'choke' at every trigger. Connect it to the \; inlet of another voice to cut that voice off \, e.g. \; [trxch~] outlet 1 -> [trxoh~] inlet. \; 'dump' sends 'dump efmrs v0 v1 ...' to outlet 1 - keep it in \; [text define -k] and send it back to restore the controls., f 64;
